<title>BANGLADESH: Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>BANGLADESH,  Jan 15 - Khulna, loading/unloading operations at mona port returned to normal as of 1900, jan 13.</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, Jan 16 - Karachi port conditions - two container vessels, first waiting three days. One vehicle carrier waiting one day. Nine fertiliser vessels, first waiting 15 days, and one loader waiting five days. Five other vessels laid up off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
